<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-4.5pt;"><img src="2509.16413v1/../assets/pico-logo.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:77/21;" width="77" height="21" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span>A Modular Framework for Hypothesis-Driven Small Language Model Research
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Richard Diehl Martinez    
David Demitri Africa    
Yuval Weiss<span id="footnotex1" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup>
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">2</span>
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
        <a href="https://the-decoder.com/gpt-4-has-a-trillion-parameters" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://the-decoder.com/gpt-4-has-a-trillion-parameters</a></span></span></span>
</span><span id="id2" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_correspondence ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span><span id="id2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Corresponding author: richard@picolm.io</span></span></span></span><span id="id3" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_contribution ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span><span id="id3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Equal contribution</span></span></span></span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">
Suchir Salhan    
