</span></td>
<td id="S1.T1.2.8.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding:1.25pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="S1.T1.2.8.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:62.6pt;">
<span id="S1.T1.2.8.5.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1.T1.2.8.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">✗</span></span>
</span></td>
