<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Comparison of <span id="A2.T4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">pico-decoder</span> model variants trained with default <span id="A2.T4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">pico-train</span> configurations. Except for hidden and feed-forward dimension, all models share the training settings detailed in <a href="#A1.T3" title="In Appendix A Default pico-train configurations ‣ A Modular Framework for Hypothesis-Driven Small Language Model Research" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>. Models are trained for 125,000 total training steps on 16 NVIDIA A100-SXM4-80GB GPUs. Time reported in GPU hours (h), minutes (m) and seconds (s); checkpoint time and storage reported per checkpoint step.</figcaption>
</figure>
