<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Overview of built-in metrics in <span id="A3.T5.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">pico-analyze</span>. <span id="A3.T5.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Data Types</span> indicates on what types of checkpoint data the metrics can be applied. The <span id="A3.T5.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Category</span> column classifies metrics based on their primary purpose.</figcaption>
